# =============================================================================
# .gitignore for SBQR.Service (three-service .NET 10 + ASP.NET Core solution)
# =============================================================================
# See PUKU.md §11: secrets MUST NEVER be committed. This file enforces that rule
# at the git level by ignoring local config files and known-secret patterns.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated Postman exports (may embed real tokens once used) - see
# .claude/skills/postman-export/SKILL.md
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.postman/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fetched/patched OpenAPI documents used as input to Dart SDK generation - see
# tools/dart-sdk-export/README.md. Ephemeral: regenerated from the live API.
# The generated SDK itself (sdks/dart/bqr_public_client/) IS committed.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.openapi/

